{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52661","headline":"三门赋附歌 · 赵冬曦","name":"三门赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甲负石兮空自奇，客乘查兮何远爲。\n君不见虚舟之泛泛，浩浩乘流而不羁。\n（见《文苑英华》卷三四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52661.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52661","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}